   "source": [
    "# 17. HTTP CONTENT NEGOTIATION"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "f007d1c3-0c89-4bea-aa99-9d82d72050a0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Content negotiation is the process of selecting the most\n",
    "appropriate representation of a resource based on client\n",
    "preferences and available representations.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "A website has:\n",
    "    English version\n",
    "    Marathi version\n",
    "\n",
    "Client sends:\n",
    "\n",
    "GET /article HTTP/1.1\n",
    "Accept-Language: mr\n",
    "\n",
    "The server may return the Marathi representation.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "1. SERVER-DRIVEN NEGOTIATION\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "The server chooses the representation based on\n",
    "request headers.\n",
    "\n",
    "Common headers:\n",
    "\n",
    "    Accept\n",
    "    Accept-Language\n",
    "    Accept-Encoding\n",
    "    Accept-Charset\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "Accept-Language: mr\n",
    "\n",
    "    ↓\n",
    "\n",
    "Server selects Marathi content.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "2. AGENT-DRIVEN NEGOTIATION\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "The server provides information about available\n",
    "representations, and the client/user-agent chooses\n",
    "which one to use.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "Available:\n",
    "    article.html\n",
    "    article.pdf\n",
    "\n",
    "Client chooses the required representation.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "3. TRANSPARENT NEGOTIATION\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "The server provides negotiation information to a cache,\n",
    "allowing the cache to help select the appropriate\n",
    "representation for future requests.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "MEMORY TRICK\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Content Negotiation\n",
    "    → \"Which version of the resource should be returned?\"\n",
    "\n",
    "Server-driven\n",
    "    → Server chooses\n",
    "\n",
    "Agent-driven\n",
    "    → Client chooses\n",
    "\n",
    "Transparent\n",
    "    → Cache helps with selection\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "SUMMARY\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Content negotiation allows HTTP to provide different\n",
    "representations of the same resource according to\n",
    "client preferences.\n",
    "\n",
    "Examples of preferences:\n",
    "\n",
    "    Language → Accept-Language\n",
    "    Format   → Accept\n",
    "    Encoding → Accept-Encoding"
   ]
  }
 ],
